      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently, this being \"Play\" only eliminates my primary use case: prop sounds.\n\nI have 6+ different sound sources I could condense into one with PlayOneShot, but they wouldn't work with \"Play\".\n\nPlay really only adds benefit for mutually-exclusive audio as-is.",
